{{Term/Store|Beetle|Beetles|Series, LA, LADX, OoS, OoA, TMC, EoW|plural}} are recurring [[Enemy|Enemies]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= E |publisher= |page= 165 {{Exp Game|LA, OoS, OoA, TMC}}}}</ref><ref name="EoW Notebook"/>{{Name Ref|LANS}}

==Characteristics==
==={{LA|-}}===
In {{LA}}, Beetles appear from a hole in the ground south of [[Kanalet Castle]] whenever [[Link]] gets close. They can be defeated with a single [[Sword]] slash, but endlessly continue appearing from the hole.

==={{OoS|-}}===
In {{OoS}}, Beetles can appear when Link digs a hole using the [[Shovel]].

==={{OoA|-}}===
In {{OoA}}, Beetles can appear when Link digs a hole using the [[Shovel]].

==={{TMC|-}}===
{{Descriptions TMC}}
In {{TMC}}, [[Black Beetles]] appear under [[Rock]]s and [[Grass]] or when digging with the [[Mole Mitts]]. If they grab Link, he will not be able to move until he swings his Sword. [[Red Beetles]] appear in the [[Fortress of Winds]].

