{{Descriptions EoW|Beetle}}
{{Stub|EoW}}
Beetles can be found in [[Cave]]s throughout [[Hyrule]]. They tend to move in swarms and will pursue prey once a target is spotted. [[Beetle Mound]]s can spawn Beetles indefinitely until they are destroyed.<ref name="EoW Notebook 2"/> When summoned as an [[Echo]], they have an Echo cost of one.

==Nomenclature==
The Beetle's Japanese name, "Zoro Zoro", is derived from the Japanese onomatopoeia for insects skittering around.
